  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We’re gonna go for Tyrantrum! It’s called the\nDespot Pokémon—you can’t beat that!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That’s what you say, but I think Aurorus is plenty\nstrong too.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006800610074201900730020007700680061007400200079006F00750020007300610079002C0020006200750074002000490020007400680069006E006B0020004100750072006F00720075007300200069007300200070006C0065006E00740079000A007300740072006F006E006700200074006F006F002E00100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hey, you’re a Trainer, right? Maybe you can help\nus. Which do you prefer: Tyrantrum or Aurorus?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hey, leave strangers out of it! We already know\nwhat we’re getting—a Jaw Fossil!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Besides, I’m the one who gets to decide which\nPokémon we’re adding to our team.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI don’t care what my little sister says!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 128
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You’re so mean!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F007520190072006500200073006F0020006D00650061006E002100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Please, could you show my brother how strong\nAurorus can be?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006C0065006100730065002C00200063006F0075006C006400200079006F0075002000730068006F00770020006D0079002000620072006F007400680065007200200068006F00770020007300740072006F006E0067000A004100750072006F007200750073002000630061006E002000620065003F00100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I bet he’ll change his mind if you defeat his\nPokémon with nothing but an Aurorus!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I know how you can get one, too! Just get hold of\na Sail Fossil and restore it into an Amaura.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAfter that, you can evolve Amaura into Aurorus by\nleveling it up!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 168
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Come let me know when you’re ready to take on\nmy brother with nothing but an Aurorus.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I know all about Aurorus! Get a Sail Fossil and\nrestore it into an Amaura, then you can evolve<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nAmaura into Aurorus by leveling it up.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nPlease, beat my brother using just one Aurorus!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 192
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You better only have one Aurorus on your team if\nwe’re gonna battle. That’s what my sister wants.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, you brought an Aurorus! Thank you so much!\nAre you ready to battle?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let’s do this!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500742019007300200064006F0020007400680069007300210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I need more time",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020006E0065006500640020006D006F00720065002000740069006D00650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh yes, of course... You need to be well prepared\nto show off Aurorus’s strength.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Please don’t go easy on him—you need to go all\nout if you want to prove Aurorus’s strength!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I don’t care what kind of Trainer you are, or how\nstrong Aurorus is. My Pokémon is stronger!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That was amazing! I knew Aurorus was a powerful\nPokémon!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006800610074002000770061007300200061006D0061007A0069006E00670021002000490020006B006E006500770020004100750072006F00720075007300200077006100730020006100200070006F00770065007200660075006C000A0050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "See? I told you—we should get a Sail Fossil!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300650065003F0020004900200074006F006C006400200079006F0075201400770065002000730068006F0075006C00640020006700650074002000610020005300610069006C00200046006F007300730069006C002100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That didn’t prove anything about Aurorus—it just\nshowed this Trainer is really strong, that’s all!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "M-maybe, but still...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D002D006D0061007900620065002C00200062007500740020007300740069006C006C002E002E002E00100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So next time, Nage, you should battle me with an\nAurorus of your own.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006F0020006E006500780074002000740069006D0065002C0020004E006100670065002C00200079006F0075002000730068006F0075006C006400200062006100740074006C00650020006D00650020007700690074006800200061006E000A004100750072006F0072007500730020006F006600200079006F007500720020006F0077006E002E00100002011401820000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "How else are we really going to prove how strong\nAurorus is?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006F007700200065006C0073006500200061007200650020007700650020007200650061006C006C007900200067006F0069006E006700200074006F002000700072006F0076006500200068006F00770020007300740072006F006E0067000A004100750072006F007200750073002000690073003F00100002011401820000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "S-so does that mean...?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053002D0073006F00200064006F00650073002000740068006100740020006D00650061006E002E002E002E003F00100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yeah. It means I’ll get you that Sail Fossil. But\nmake sure you raise Amaura properly!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thank you so much for battling my brother!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680061006E006B00200079006F007500200073006F0020006D00750063006800200066006F007200200062006100740074006C0069006E00670020006D0079002000620072006F0074006800650072002100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I promise I’ll raise the strongest Aurorus in the\nworld!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049002000700072006F006D006900730065002000492019006C006C00200072006100690073006500200074006800650020007300740072006F006E00670065007300740020004100750072006F00720075007300200069006E0020007400680065000A0077006F0072006C0064002100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿 ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00200000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We’re gonna get along great, Amaura.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006520190072006500200067006F006E006E0061002000670065007400200061006C006F006E0067002000670072006500610074002C00200041006D0061007500720061002E00100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll battle Nage when her Amaura evolves. It’ll be\nTyrantrum versus Aurorus—the showdown!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
